          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "тост (tost) was borrowed from English toast (EtymDB), from Old French toster \"to roast\", from Latin tostus \"roasted\", the participle of torrēre \"to parch\"."
            }
          ]
